# oracle: min_style cg, default min_modify line quadratic, an LJ cluster (lj units, thermo norm yes), 30 iterations, every thermo row
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box), all 31 rows: max relative error of the engine pe 2.1e-15, fnorm 2.3e-9 (fnorm near 1e-5, where round-off of the forces dominates).
# oracle-inputs: w150mn_lj_cluster.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
boundary        f f f
read_data       w150mn_lj_cluster.data
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
min_style       cg
thermo_style    custom step pe fnorm
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
minimize        0 0 30 1000
